---
description: Decide field-level findings for recoverBrandConstraints.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Translate the client brief, product facts, and existing assets into desired associations and hard constraints. Separate aspirational positioning from demonstrable capability, identify legal or rights review needs, and preserve audience guidance without inferring personal traits. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
